# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Generate the noise-mitigating observable {#2-generate-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"
msgstr "2. Générer l'observable qui mitige le bruit {#2-generate-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[generate_noise_mitigating_observable](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-pna/qiskit-addon-pna#generate_noise_mitigating_observable) propagates each Pauli generator of the inverse noise channel forward to the end of the circuit. The observable is then back-propagated through the inverse noise channel, returning a new observable $\\tilde{O}$. Three key parameters affect the computation cost:\n"
msgstr "[generate_noise_mitigating_observable](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-pna/qiskit-addon-pna#generate_noise_mitigating_observable) propage chaque générateur de Pauli du canal de bruit inverse vers l'avant jusqu'à la fin du circuit. L'observable est ensuite rétropropagée à travers le canal de bruit inverse, ce qui renvoie une nouvelle observable $\\tilde{O}$. Trois paramètres clés influent sur le coût de calcul :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`max_err_terms`: the number of terms kept in each anti-noise generator as it is propagated forward.\n"
msgstr "`max_err_terms` : le nombre de termes conservés dans chaque générateur d'anti-bruit au fil de sa propagation vers l'avant.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`max_obs_terms`: the number of terms kept in $\\tilde{O}$.\n"
msgstr "`max_obs_terms` : le nombre de termes conservés dans $\\tilde{O}$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`atol`: terms with coefficient magnitude below this threshold are dropped.\n"
msgstr "`atol` : les termes dont la magnitude du coefficient est inférieure à ce seuil sont supprimés.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For this small, near-Clifford circuit we set the term limits high and use a modest `atol`, so $\\tilde{O}$ stays small and we can measure all of its terms.\n"
msgstr "Pour ce petit circuit proche de Clifford, nous fixons des limites de termes élevées et utilisons un `atol` modeste, de sorte que $\\tilde{O}$ reste petite et que nous puissions mesurer tous ses termes.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "***Note: This function uses Python `multiprocessing`. When running as a script, call it inside an `if __name__ == \"__main__\":` guard.***\n"
msgstr "***Remarque : cette fonction utilise `multiprocessing` de Python. Lors de l'exécution en tant que script, appelle-la à l'intérieur d'une garde `if __name__ == \"__main__\":`.***\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Mitigate gate errors by measuring the noise-mitigating observable {#3-mitigate-gate-errors-by-measuring-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"
msgstr "3. Mitiger les erreurs de porte en mesurant l'observable qui mitige le bruit {#3-mitigate-gate-errors-by-measuring-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we see that the new observable effectively mitigates the gate noise affecting the experiment.\n"
msgstr "Ici, nous voyons que la nouvelle observable mitige efficacement le bruit de porte affectant l'expérience.\n"

